  "oracle_text": "Kicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} as you cast this spell.)\nWhen this creature enters, if it was kicked, search your library for a land card with a basic land type, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\n{R}, {T}, Sacrifice a land: Draw a card."
